l8589941492: 610 l8589941491 l8589935988 # Has value (l8589941491, "Language variants aren’t handled as format variants of the languages they are variants of, since there aren’t tons of possible combinations (at least that are practical to support). Instead, the type is given as lv: followed by the language identifier of which they are a variant (without the lang_ prefix).")
